# Kept out of the build context – the files `docker build .` sends to the builder.

# Made by the build itself: the image installs and builds its own, for Linux.
node_modules
dist
.angular
# .NET's build output from the Mac. obj/ holds the restore's files with the Mac's paths, which
# would break `dotnet publish --no-restore` in the image.
**/bin
**/obj

